  issuingFactionId: guild
  charges: Nine counts of extortion. Live preferred.
  whoTheyActuallyAre: 'Worse than the board. He runs a protection racket across two
    arcs and has been drowning people in a sump for eleven years. There is a room
    in his place with shoes in it and the shoes are sorted by size. The approach
    walks the player through it before they ever see him.


    When beaten: "You''re
    not going to kill me. You people never do. There''s no money in it."'
